{"4641370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ember's Oath", "steam_appid": 4641370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/bb3c19b6350786c6f46964e7cf28c2d3.avif?t=1788211017\" width=720 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ember’s Oath</i> is a third-person, action-adventure, combat-focused game where players take on the role of a shapeshifting mage capable of transforming into a phoenix. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/88dc0e578632b65dccc4bd4778bb3e13.poster.avif?t=1788211017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/88dc0e578632b65dccc4bd4778bb3e13.webm?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/88dc0e578632b65dccc4bd4778bb3e13.mp4?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a dark and corrupted world where magic is being systematically destroyed, the game features high-intensity combat requiring players to switch fluidly between humanoid and phoenix forms to defeat herds of mechanical beasts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/34ef6b5d53b8e7f4057ddd09eea5c0e0.poster.avif?t=1788211017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/34ef6b5d53b8e7f4057ddd09eea5c0e0.webm?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/34ef6b5d53b8e7f4057ddd09eea5c0e0.mp4?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's ability to shapeshift introduces a dynamic layer to combat, offering a distinct playstyle with powerful unique abilities and enhanced mobility options. Additionally, players become empowered as they progress through the game by unlocking new spells through a skill tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/f692996d52d31543643de3256a35c91b.avif?t=1788211017\" width=720 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ember's Oath</i> encourages discovery, featuring an open world level that can be traversed by both foot and flight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/296bc4b86a4b846d9632ab6839f5c3a5.poster.avif?t=1788211017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/296bc4b86a4b846d9632ab6839f5c3a5.webm?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/296bc4b86a4b846d9632ab6839f5c3a5.mp4?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may even be some secrets lying about as you fly and explore this dark fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/cb809c85e6f395540ad49acd287635dd.poster.avif?t=1788211017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/cb809c85e6f395540ad49acd287635dd.webm?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/cb809c85e6f395540ad49acd287635dd.mp4?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/b1b9d758cc7fff4c0f811fc19d2d4e56.avif?t=1788211017\" width=720 height=131 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-intensity combat with challenging and fun enemy encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid and intuitive flight mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different playstyles, meant to both be used in synergy with one another</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A progression system for unlocking new and powerful spells from a skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric open world level with a voice acted quest line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20-30+ minutes of gameplay</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/bb3c19b6350786c6f46964e7cf28c2d3.avif?t=1788211017\" width=720 height=153 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ember’s Oath</i> is a third-person, action-adventure, combat-focused game where players take on the role of a shapeshifting mage capable of transforming into a phoenix. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/88dc0e578632b65dccc4bd4778bb3e13.poster.avif?t=1788211017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/88dc0e578632b65dccc4bd4778bb3e13.webm?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/88dc0e578632b65dccc4bd4778bb3e13.mp4?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a dark and corrupted world where magic is being systematically destroyed, the game features high-intensity combat requiring players to switch fluidly between humanoid and phoenix forms to defeat herds of mechanical beasts. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/34ef6b5d53b8e7f4057ddd09eea5c0e0.poster.avif?t=1788211017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/34ef6b5d53b8e7f4057ddd09eea5c0e0.webm?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/34ef6b5d53b8e7f4057ddd09eea5c0e0.mp4?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player's ability to shapeshift introduces a dynamic layer to combat, offering a distinct playstyle with powerful unique abilities and enhanced mobility options. Additionally, players become empowered as they progress through the game by unlocking new spells through a skill tree. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/f692996d52d31543643de3256a35c91b.avif?t=1788211017\" width=720 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ember's Oath</i> encourages discovery, featuring an open world level that can be traversed by both foot and flight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/296bc4b86a4b846d9632ab6839f5c3a5.poster.avif?t=1788211017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/296bc4b86a4b846d9632ab6839f5c3a5.webm?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/296bc4b86a4b846d9632ab6839f5c3a5.mp4?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There may even be some secrets lying about as you fly and explore this dark fantasy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/cb809c85e6f395540ad49acd287635dd.poster.avif?t=1788211017\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/cb809c85e6f395540ad49acd287635dd.webm?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/cb809c85e6f395540ad49acd287635dd.mp4?t=1788211017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/extras/b1b9d758cc7fff4c0f811fc19d2d4e56.avif?t=1788211017\" width=720 height=131 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-intensity combat with challenging and fun enemy encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid and intuitive flight mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two different playstyles, meant to both be used in synergy with one another</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A progression system for unlocking new and powerful spells from a skill tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An atmospheric open world level with a voice acted quest line</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20-30+ minutes of gameplay</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Play as Ember, a fire mage with the unique ability to transform herself into a phoenix. In a world where mages have been hunted to extinction, you must master the synergy between your human spells and phoenix powers in order to defeat your foes in this third-person, combat-focused fantasy adventure!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/7d2f10dbca1581d61bf90c63ff19b4dfb933a741/header.jpg?t=1788211017", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/061eea76e0d19c0b12e868c75c0de95a88a2bd82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788211017", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4641370/061eea76e0d19c0b12e868c75c0de95a88a2bd82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788211017", "website": "https://sites.google.com/view/foolswithblades/embers-oath", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><l